(Change maps compare the two rendered mosaics pixel by pixel and classify each pixel from its colour class, so they are quantised \(NDVI) Tj
T* (in 5 classes, water and built-up as binary\). Small misregistration, sun-angle and atmospheric differences can create spurious change at) Tj
T* (field edges.) Tj
