(Comparison windows are about +/-10 days around each date, and the change-map mosaics may use up to +/-30 days when clear) Tj
T* (imagery is scarce, so they represent the window rather than one acquisition day. Fire hotspots are 375 m VIIRS thermal detections.) Tj
T* (Results are indicative and should be validated with ground data or high-resolution imagery before use in decisions or publication.) Tj
